I stand in front of the bread in the supermarket.
There is so much bread on the shelves.
In Mexico, the bread is white and soft.
But the Danish bread is different.
Here there is dark rye bread everywhere.
The Danish rye bread is dark and very heavy.
There are so many different kinds.
Which one should I take?
I am not sure.
I look for a bit and choose one.
The rye bread feels very heavy in my hand.
The Danes love this bread.
Maybe I will like it too.
I put the dark bread in my shopping cart.
Now I need to find something to put on the bread.
